    {
      "id": "JGoHdGeiedzriIAkgeBQP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6557.481252558127,
      "y": -515.8050021256585,
      "width": 1503.550048828125,
      "height": 135,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cjxP66tCEWk2R_8Z_JB_",
      "index": "bBA",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1197016728,
      "version": 308,
      "versionNonce": 1750365533,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770595580734,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "En caso que la propiedad de que χ(H) ≤ χ(G) falle porq no encontramos un subgrafo H\nadecuado para la prueba, podríamos recurrir al absurdo: Suponer que existe un coloreo\npropio con k - 1 colores y mediante deducciones llegar a la contradicción. ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "En caso que la propiedad de que χ(H) ≤ χ(G) falle porq no encontramos un subgrafo H\nadecuado para la prueba, podríamos recurrir al absurdo: Suponer que existe un coloreo\npropio con k - 1 colores y mediante deducciones llegar a la contradicción. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VL2c5lDElhKHC78Forzms",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6564.200092763287,
      "y": -314.02344854944045,
      "width": 402.3666687011719,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c2255c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cjxP66tCEWk2R_8Z_JB_",
      "index": "bBC",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 386084504,
      "version": 45,
      "versionNonce": 1297996531,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770595580734,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Obs a tener en cuenta:",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Obs a tener en cuenta:",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "p7BCAWf70DHm6ExonAsFk",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 6548.552387290658,
      "y": -332.8006951165948,
      "width": 431.87667104454704,
      "height": 76.15216663345876,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#c2255c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "3cjxP66tCEWk2R_8Z_JB_",
      "index": "bBD",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 777500136,
      "version": 59,
      "versionNonce": 607633853,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
